</ul>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Cold Start Performance: The <1 Second Advantage</h2>

<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-4">fal.ai's sub-second cold start is the single most important technical differentiator. In serverless GPU inference, "cold start" is the time between the first request to a model and the first inference result, when the GPU must be loaded with the model weights. Most platforms cache hot models for 10-30 minutes of inactivity, then evict and require a full reload.</p>

